    },
    {
      "id": "osg23",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "If we rotate the coordinate system so that the ramp is horizontal, then the free fall acceleration will have two components one downward <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math> and one horizontal <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ.&nbsp;</mi></mrow></mrow></math>In this frame, the initial velocity will have components given by <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math> &amp; <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math> time for each bounce is given by <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />The horizontal displacement <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />given these equation<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Since <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
